title: Recruitment Drive
new-page: true
view-if: recruitment_timer <= 0
on-arrival: recruitment_timer = 3; month_actions += 1
frequency: 300
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs

= Recruitment Drive

Thousands of workers are disappointed in Ebert's republic. A recruitment drive could bring them into the party, but only the districts loyal to the Zentrale will put real effort into it.

Members in loyal districts: [+ loyal_share_display +]%.

- @drive: Fund a recruitment drive.
- @local: Leave recruitment to the districts.
- @easy_discard

@drive
subtitle: Costs 1 fund. Loyal districts grow faster than defiant ones.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We have no funds.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
for (var d of Q.districts) {
    var grow = Q['district_' + d + '_loyalty'] >= 50 ? 0.15 : 0.05;
    Q['district_' + d + '_members'] *= 1 + grow;
}
Q.worker_support += 2;
!}

Organisers fan out to factories and labour exchanges. The loyal districts report a stream of new members; the others take the money and do as they please.

@local
on-arrival: {!
for (var d of Q.districts) {
    Q['district_' + d + '_members'] *= 1.04;
    Q['district_' + d + '_loyalty'] -= 2;
}
!}

The districts recruit in their own way and in their own image.
